OL,3,ACar finance compensation payments
OL,4,Aexplained
OL,5,
OL,6,FMillions of drivers who were mis-sold
OL,7,Fcar finance agreements could face
OL,8,Ffurther delays to compensation after
OL,9,Fthe financial regulator said it had
OL,10,Fmade some errors in its calculations.
OL,12,FDriver have already been told they must
OL,13,Fwait until at least 2027 to receive
OL,14,Fcompensation, although some may be
OL,15,Foffered an early settlement.
OL,17,FAverage payments of about #829 are
OL,18,Fexpected under the rules published by
OL,19,Fthe Financial Conduct Authority (FCA).
